    "content": {
      "format": "markdown",
      "body": "- THE SYSTEM SHALL emit timestamps in RFC3339 with explicit UTC offset (`Z`), regardless of the report's display timezone."
    },
    "rationale": "Mixed-locale teams hit ambiguous timestamps weekly; pinning to RFC3339-Z removes the foot-gun.",
